# Smart routing

- Start with **`CONTEXT.md`**. Non-trivial work: `/ask-matt` (or Matt `research` / `grill-with-docs`), then **`docs/AI_WORKFLOW.md`**.
- UI/JSX: read **`design-system/MCP-UI/MASTER.md`** before editing `client/`.
- After clone: `npm run skills:install`, then `/setup-matt-pocock-skills` once.
- Use project `implement-feature` with Matt `implement`/`tdd`. Do not run two TDD skills.
